<h1>Merondo Ledger</h1>
<p>Merondo Ledger is a workflow tool used by agencies. The company was founded in 2005 and is headquartered in Bergen. The current release is v7.9.5.</p>
<p>Plans start at $9 per seat per month, billed annually. A single workspace supports up to 120 members, and every user gets 15 GB of storage. New accounts get a free trial of 10 days.</p>
<p>The public API allows 300 requests per minute per token. Human support is available Friday–Sunday, 08:00–21:00 UTC.</p>
